      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## Backlog cleanup\nLabels existing inbox mail from the last 12 months with the same prompt as AI Inbox Agent (sub-workflow **Classify email**).\n\n**Settings**: LIMIT per mailbox (0 = all), BATCH_SIZE / WAIT_SECONDS (Gmail), OUTLOOK_BATCH_SIZE / OUTLOOK_WAIT_SECONDS, COUNT_ONLY (true = only count + estimate).\n\nOutlook calls go one at a time (Graph allows 4 concurrent requests per mailbox). On 429/503/504 the batch waits max(Retry-After, 60 s) and retries, up to 5 times.\n\nOutput of **Count + estimate** shows totals and cost before anything is labeled. Processed mails are logged in Data Table **processed_mails** and skipped in later runs. Mails where Claude failed are not logged and are picked up again next run.",
